Name the optimisation technique that would be applied to the fragment below.

```c
int area(int w, int h) {
    return w * h;
    printf("Area calculated");
}
```

Rewrite the fragment below so that it is optimised. The result must stay the same.

```c
int x = 10;
int unused = 99;
int y = x * 4 + x * 4;
if (0) {
    printf("Never");
}
printf("%d", y);
```

